### Test Diabetes Symptoms - Should predict Diabetes
POST http://localhost:5051/api/v2/symptoms/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 35,
  "gender": "female",
  "symptoms": [
    {
      "name": "thirst",
      "severity": "mild",
      "duration": 4
    },
    {
      "name": "dry mouth",
      "severity": "severe", 
      "duration": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "frequent urination",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "duration": 4
    }
  ],
  "additionalInfo": "string"
}

### Test Stroke Symptoms - Should predict Stroke  
POST http://localhost:5051/api/v2/symptoms/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 65,
  "symptoms": [
    {
      "name": "slurred speech",
      "severity": "severe",
      "duration": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "paralysis",
      "severity": "severe", 
      "duration": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "confusion",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "duration": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Get Predefined Questions for Enhanced Diagnosis
GET http://localhost:5051/api/v2/symptoms/questions

### Get Follow-up Questions for Diabetes
POST http://localhost:5051/api/v2/symptoms/follow-up-questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "primaryDiagnosis": "Diabetes",
  "symptoms": ["thirst", "frequent urination", "blurred vision"]
}